Hexes your target and everything within a radius 2 ball around it for 20 turns. Each time an affected target uses a resource (stamina, mana, vim, …), it takes [53, 71, 85, 97, 108 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage.

In addition, the cooldown of any talent used while so hexed is increased by [15%, 26%, 35%, 43%, 50% (TL1-5)] + 1 turn.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
